[{"answer":"Good morning. You're through to the tourist information office.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Tim speaking. How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you give me some information about next month's festival, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/4.mp3"},{"answer":"My family and I will be staying in the town that week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it starts with a concert on the afternoon of the 17th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh I heard about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/8.mp3"},{"answer":"The orchestra and singers come from the USA, don't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/9.mp3"},{"answer":"They're from Canada.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/10.mp3"},{"answer":"They're very popular over there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/11.mp3"},{"answer":"They're going to perform a number of well-known pieces that will appeal to children as well as adults.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/12.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/13.mp3"},{"answer":"My whole family are interested in music.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/14.mp3"},{"answer":"The next day, the 18th,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/15.mp3"},{"answer":"there's a performance by a ballet company called Eustatis.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/17.mp3"},{"answer":"The name is spelt E-U-S-T-A-T-I-S.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/18.mp3"},{"answer":"They appeared in last year's festival, and went down very well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Again, their programme is designed for all ages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I expect we'll go to that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope there's going to be a play during the festival, a comedy, ideally.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/23.mp3"},{"answer":"You're in luck!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/24.mp3"},{"answer":"On the 19th and 20th a local amateur group are performing one written by a member of the group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/25.mp3"},{"answer":"It's called Jemima.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/26.mp3"},{"answer":"That'll be on in the town hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/27.mp3"},{"answer":"They've already performed it two or three times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't seen it myself,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/29.mp3"},{"answer":"but the review in the local paper was very good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/30.mp3"},{"answer":"And is it suitable for children?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, in fact it's aimed more at children than at adults,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/32.mp3"},{"answer":"so both performances are in the afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about dance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Will there be any performances?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, also on the 20th, but in the evening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/36.mp3"},{"answer":"A professional company is putting on a show of modern pieces,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/37.mp3"},{"answer":"with electronic music by young composers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh-huh.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/39.mp3"},{"answer":"The show is about how people communicate, or fail to communicate, with each other,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/40.mp3"},{"answer":"so it's got the rather strange name, Chat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose that's because that's something we do both face to face and online.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/42.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Now there are also some workshops and other activities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/44.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll all take place at least once every day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/45.mp3"},{"answer":"so everyone who wants to take part will have a chance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/47.mp3"},{"answer":"We're particularly interested in cookery -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/48.mp3"},{"answer":"you don't happen to have a cookery workshop, do you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/49.mp3"},{"answer":"We certainly do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It's going to focus on how to make food part of a healthy lifestyle,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/51.mp3"},{"answer":"and it'll show that even sweet things like cakes can contain much less sugar than they usually do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/52.mp3"},{"answer":"That might be worth going to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/53.mp3"},{"answer":"We're trying to encourage our children to cook.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Another workshop is just for children,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/55.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's on creating posters to reflect the history of the town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/56.mp3"},{"answer":"The aim is to make children aware of how both the town and people's lives have changed over the centuries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/57.mp3"},{"answer":"The results will be exhibited in the community centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the other workshop is in toy-making,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's for adults only.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, why's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Because it involves carpentry -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/62.mp3"},{"answer":"participants will be making toys out of wood,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/63.mp3"},{"answer":"so there'll be a lot of sharp chisels and other tools around.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/64.mp3"},{"answer":"It makes sense to keep children away from it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Now let me tell you about some of the outdoor activities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/67.mp3"},{"answer":"There'll be supervised wild swimming...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Wild swimming?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/69.mp3"},{"answer":"What's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/70.mp3"},{"answer":"It just means swimming in natural waters, rather than a swimming pool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/72.mp3"},{"answer":"In a lake, for instance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there's a beautiful one just outside the town,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/74.mp3"},{"answer":"and that'll be the venue for the swimming.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/75.mp3"},{"answer":"There'll be lifeguards on duty, so it's suitable for all ages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/76.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally, there'll be a walk in some nearby woods every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/77.mp3"},{"answer":"The leader is an expert on insects.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/78.mp3"},{"answer":"He'll show some that live in the woods, and how important they are for the environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/79.mp3"},{"answer":"So there are going to be all sorts of different things to do during the festival.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/80.mp3"},{"answer":"There certainly are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/81.mp3"},{"answer":"If you'd like to read about how the preparations for the festival are going,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/82.mp3"},{"answer":"the festival organizer is keeping a blog.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Just search online for the festival website, and you'll find it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thank you very much for all the information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/85.mp3"},{"answer":"You're welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-1-2023-01-14-19-42-49/88.mp3"}]
